  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-250-282">空はにごれる白亜の色</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-282-309">北国の――悩ましき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-309-336"><rb>擾乱</rb><rt>じょうらん</rt></ruby></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-338-376">大地ははっちを閉じている</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-376-390">………</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-390-428">地平の彼方――友等処女等</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-428-446">同じくなやめ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-446-473"><rb>同胞</rb><rt>きょうだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-473-478">達</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-478-492">………</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-492-519">北極の襲い来れる、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-519-540"><rb>白鵞</rb><rt>はくが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-540-551">の万毛</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-551-607">風をよび、吹きなす、ひょうひょうの声</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-607-642">木をゆるぎ、屋根をはぐ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-642-656">………</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-656-673">狂暴の形態</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-673-688">天魔の降臨</seg></p>
    </body>
